OL,3,GNEWSAToy swaps aim to cut Christmas
OL,4,Acosts and waste
OL,5,
OL,6,FToy swaps are being held in Surrey as
OL,7,Fpart of a nationwide effort to help
OL,8,Ffamilies save money and reduce waste
OL,9,Fbefore Christmas.
OL,11,FEvents in Ash and Elmbridge have joined
OL,12,FThe Big Toy Swap, which is taking place
OL,13,Fat more than 80 locations across Great
OL,14,FBritain between October and December.
OL,16,FPeople are invited to donate toys,
OL,17,Fbooks and games in good condition
OL,18,Fbefore choosing pre-loved items to take
OL,19,Fhome.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
